362: ## SM.7. Exact source coordinates at the remaining zero puncture
363: 
364: Working source-chart calculation only; no completed-family return is assigned.
365: Put \(v=u^3\) and use the literal global coordinate change
366: \[
367:  X=u^2x,\qquad Y=u^3y,\qquad T=u^4t.
368: \]
369: It transforms the marked source into
370: \[
371:  Y^2=X^3+(1-2v)X^2+TX+v^2,\qquad G=(0,v),
372:  \qquad T_0=v^2-2v.
373: \]
374: These coordinates descend under the exact marked \(\mu_3\) maps of SM.1:
375: all three of \(X,Y,T\) are unchanged. The selected cubic is exactly
376: \[
377:  P(X,T_0)=(X-v)^2(X+1).
378: \]
379: Its discriminant is
380: \[
